  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Black card’s done. Properly set up, clean accounts, no paper trail that leads anywhere useful. Deposited the exact amoun",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 791
        }
      ],
      "words": 32
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The name embossed on the card sits there in clean silver lettering. ‘Christopher Sinclair.’",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1185
        },
        {
          "text": "Armen doesn’t miss the pause; of course he doesn’t. “Gotta say boss",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1275
        },
        {
          "text": "interesting choice of surname.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1341
        }
      ],
      "words": 31
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "That surname probably has fucking alarm bells tied to Zero Hour. Anyone with half a brain and the right connections star",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1786
        }
      ],
      "words": 38
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "You could’ve gone with anything. Smith, Jones",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2142
        },
        {
          "text": "some random nothing name",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2188
        },
        {
          "text": "I could have chosen any fake name in existence. Any neutral, forgettable surname that meant nothing. So why the fuck did",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2431
        }
      ],
      "words": 37
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I enter the code, making sure Armen can see it, open it, and place the black folder containing the card and the account ",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2733
        },
        {
          "text": "“The code is only for emergencies,” I tell him. “You don’t open this unless I’m dead or something has gone seriously wro",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 2970
        }
      ],
      "words": 53
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There’s no clear threat, no name, no direction I can point to. Just a quiet, persistent sense that something is shifting",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4337
        },
        {
          "text": "something distant but already fated, drawing closer with every hour that passes. Something I can’t see yet, and somehow,",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 4458
        }
      ],
      "words": 52
    },
    {
      "block": "原句7",
      "no": 7,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I hate not knowing. I’ve built everything on control, on seeing the board clearly before anyone else moves. This",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5008
        },
        {
          "text": "blank, formless pressure sits wrong under my skin",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5121
        },
        {
          "text": "A crack I can’t locate",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5172
        },
        {
          "text": "A weakness I can’t name yet",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5195
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    }
  ],
